# Python Port Plan · 00 · Configuration

Status: DRAFT — open questions below must be answered before implementation starts.

## Goal

Port `week1_baseline/ruby/00_config` to Python, landing it in the already-created
(empty) `week1_baseline/python/00_config` directory, with behavior equivalent to
the Ruby implementation described in `@week1_baseline/ruby/00_config/README.md`.

This is the first of several `NN_*` steps that will need porting as week1_baseline
grows (see `@week1_baseline/ruby/00_config/README.md` framing of "as we add
configuration in each iteration we will be updating the configuration schema and
class"), so the Python layout and conventions chosen here set the pattern for
later steps.

